# Evolve TEE App Environment Configuration
#
# This TEE app is self-contained and receives all data via POST requests.
# No external RPC endpoints or middleware are required.
#
# The app exposes the following endpoints:
# - POST /attestation - Main endpoint for block verification and attestation
# - GET /health - Health check
# - GET /info - TEE environment information
# - GET /quote - Simple TEE quote (for testing)